# 统一换行与二进制判定
# 目的：避免 Windows（CRLF）与 Linux/macOS（LF）混用导致每个文件都显示"已修改"
* text=auto eol=lf

*.py    text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.txt   text eol=lf
*.sql   text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.toml  text eol=lf
*.bat   text eol=crlf
*.ps1   text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不做换行转换，也不在 diff 里展开
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.bmp   binary
*.ico   binary
*.onnx  binary
*.pt    binary
*.db    binary
*.pdf   binary
*.zip   binary

# GitHub 语言统计：把文档类文件排除，避免仓库被识别成"以 Markdown 为主"
docs/** linguist-documentation
*.md    linguist-documentation
